ney General Colin McDonald and the entire team at @DOJFraudDiv for your tireless work in making sure these fraudsters are found and prosecuted to the fullest extent of the law.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":19040,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2082143741708501395","post_id":"2082143741708501395","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2082143741708501395","published_at":"2026-07-28T16:38:47.040Z","published_date":"2026-07-28","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"It was an honor to spend this morning remembering my friend Lindsey Graham and having the opportunity to share stories about the impact he had on my life in public service.\n\nUsha and I continue to pray for his family, friends, staff, and loved ones through this difficult time.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":30480,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"