udsters for $547M in fraud\n\n- @SecScottBessent successfully implemented a verification process to stop payments from going to dead people\n\n- @SecretaryTurner suspended funding to the Virgin Islands amid a massive fraud investigation\n\n- @SecKennedy, @DrOzCMS deferred $1B in Medicaid payments to CA and MN\n\nFraudsters be warned: if you steal from the American people, we will hunt you down.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":41763,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2079706120105439271","post_id":"2079706120105439271","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2079706120105439271","published_at":"2026-07-21T23:12:32.761Z","published_date":"2026-07-21","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"If only there was a way to stop this type of “software error” that allowed non citizens to vote in our elections.\n\nI hope Senators @CoryBooker and @SenatorAndyKim will join us in voting to pass the SAVE America Act to ensure that only eligible American voters can participate in New Jersey elections, and all elections across the United States.","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":70697,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-pub