a partisan issue, it is an AMERICAN ISSUE. \n\nLet us unite and pass the SAVE America Act and ensure every American's right to vote in a free and fair election is protected.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":92024,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2077896255666000073","post_id":"2077896255666000073","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2077896255666000073","published_at":"2026-07-16T23:20:47.453Z","published_date":"2026-07-16","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"This is completely bogus. I never received a message like this. \n\nIf I had, I would have said: Jared and Steve are trusted members of the president's team and very dear friends. No one has done more than the two of them to work towards peace and prosperity in the region. The idea they're trading on insider information is absurd.\n\nI see a lot of BS flying around and I normally just ignore it. But Steve and Jared are good dudes and I'm honored to work with them.","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":28304,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2077760984353997253","post_id":"2077760984353997253","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2077760984353997253","published_at":"2026-07-16T14:23:16.259Z","published_date":"2026-07-16","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Our Republican majority has accomplished a lot despite narrow margins. It’s time for us to unite again and do something that really matters: fund our troops, support our farmers, and secure our elections. \n\nLet’s deliver for the people who sent us here and use reconciliation to send as much of the SAVE America Act as possible to President Trump’s desk.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":49283,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2077142741528592887","post_id":"2077142741528592887","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2077142741528592887","published_at":"2026-07-14T21:26:35.683Z","published_date":"2026-07-14","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Our administration owes a debt of gratitude to Nick Shirley for exposing one of the most egregious cases of fraud this country has ever seen. \n\nIf the media was worth their salt, they would take notes from Nick and other citizen journalists who care about investigating stories that affect the American people instead of trying to silence them.","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":212343,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2076305713576509465","post_id":"2076305713576509465","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2076305713576509465","published_at":"2026-07-12T14:00:32.668Z","published_date":"2026-07-12","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Lindsey Graham came from humble beginnings and became one of the most powerful lawmakers in the most powerful nation on Earth. His story was a fundamentally American one.\n\nEarly in my Senate tenure, I remember getting into a shouting match with Lindsey about a Ukraine funding bill at lunch and then learning the very next day that he was pushing rail legislation I really cared about behind the scenes. That was Lindsey Graham. He fought like hell for the things he believed in, and he was just as willing to go to bat for you when it counted.\n\nLindsey had the best sense of humor in the Senate. He loved the game of politics. He was constantly asking which races were up and down, and how he could help. As he liked to say, “I don't care if you're an isolationist or a religious fanatic, so long a…","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":59351,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2075587450676670774","post_id":"2075587450676670774","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2075587450676670774","published_at":"2026-07-10T14:26:25.448Z","published_date":"2026-07-10","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Dr. Oz and Kim Brandt have been two of our all stars at fighting fraud and saving money. Check out this op-ed they wrote on their efforts.\n\nlatimes.com/opinion/story/20…","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":6790,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2074986819989426351","post_id":"2074986819989426351","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2074986819989426351","published_at":"2026-07-08T22:39:43.933Z","published_date":"2026-07-08","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"The November midterms give us a choice: keep fighting fraud with Republicans or send criminal fraudsters a life boat from the Democrats.\n\nThis is not any old election. This is a fight to maintain the social fabric of our nation and do right by the hardworking Americans we serve.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":36662,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2074509625471209839","post_id":"2074509625471209839","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2074509625471209839","published_at":"2026-07-07T15:03:31.894Z","published_date":"2026-07-07","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"From day one, President Trump and I have said this very thing. Stopping the flood of illegal migrants into this country will bring down home prices and make housing affordable again for young Americans who are trying to start a family. \n\nDespite the left’s incessant whining, Trump was right all along. Thanks to the efforts of @DHSgov and the entire Trump Administration, we stopped the flow of migrants at the border, and housing prices are beginning to come down. \n\nThere is still work to be done, but this is huge progress toward restoring the American Dream as a reality for our nation's young people who deserve a stake in their country.","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":49100,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"97bdb42ffe5fd631c62d6e8fce3c9b079a7b70e6e9e7477c6f7a23a46f4164f7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/JDVance/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYd0q__50LAAIAAAATMjA4NDY5NDc1NDkyNzc4MDM0NggAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2074261228214477124","post_id":"2074261228214477124","platform":"x","author":"JDVance","original_url":"https://x.com/JDVance/status/2074261228214477124","published_at":"2026-07-06T22:36:29.373Z","published_date":"2026-07-06","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"In the Trump Administration, we believe every American child should have a stake in their country's future. 